l Durand instructed that I am to report to you for personal tutelage!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Major Mayjor? Is this a prank? Am I getting punked?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "I don't think so, sir. Did you want to be? Was that an order? Is that my first order?!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "I always thought the General liked me.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "He must! I'm his favorite nephew!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Aren't you his only nephew?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Maybe.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Major, this is a relatively small force. I want you to use the long-range Rocket Trucks supported by the Stealth Tanks. Just try not to destroy my beautiful tanks.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "No promises, sir!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "I can't believe I did it! I won! I won everything! I'm a legend! Uncle Durand will be so proud!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Let's not be hasty. I am the master tactician and commander here. I have guided you to victory.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "But you didn't DO anything.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "It's leadership by osmosis. You benefit because I'm here. Very complicated. You wouldn't understand.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Whatever. I'm the best! Everyone will love me now!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "That glory is mine!", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "I touched it last.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Ah! What is this? A Federation contingent up ahead? Soon, this new Federation toy will be the latest weapon in the my...erm... in the Akadian arsenal.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}]}}